The pulse port provides a header-only C++23 compile-time type-routed signals
library (`#include <pulse/pulse.hpp>`), with an optional C++26 reflection
layer (`#include <pulse/pulse_meta.hpp>`).

To use it, add the following to your CMakeLists.txt:

    find_package(pulse CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(my-target PRIVATE pulse::pulse)

Optional vcpkg features:
    skills - Install AI agent skill into share/agent-skills/pulse.
